getallocator|nktp-large-target-metrics-targetallocator|nktp-watchdog-targetallocator|nktp-operator|nktp-ksm-pods|nktp-ksm-unscheduled-pods|nktp-ksm-cluster|nktp-ksm-workloads|nktp-ksm-configuration|nktp-ksm-networking|nktp-ksm-storage|nktp-node-exporter|nktp-metrics-server|metrics-server|lgtm)(-.*)?\"))), \"target\", \" / \", \"pod\", \"container\"))",
